<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.edge.lowers ~ the shadow over one relationship, lowered by a deliberate hand

`lares edge un-kapae` takes the marker over one relationship back down: name exactly one of an edge id, `member=<key>` or `device=<key>`, with `realm=<id>` where the relationship rides a realm. The act signs with a persona root (`as=<index>`) or, under `quorum=true`, the seats this vessel holds; it asserts no authority, and whichever reader consults the shadow decides whether that hand holds the edge. The marker rides the edge, never a party. A lower lands beside the raises it cites; a raise it never saw still stands, and the headline reports standing, never the gesture. `quorum=true partial=true` signs with the seats held here and prints a partial for the next seat's vessel instead (`member=`, or `voucher=` with `joiner=`, under `realm=`); `lares edge cosign` lands it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ edge · member · partial

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`edge` params=`edge/<edge-id> ~ lower by edge id`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`member` params=`member/<key> realm/<realm-id> quorum/true ~ lower a member's place under the seat quorum`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`partial` params=`member/<key> realm/<realm-id> quorum/true partial/true ~ print a partial for the next seat`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ edge · member · device · realm · quorum · partial · voucher · joiner · as · nexus · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`edge` params=`takes/edge-id seat/1 as/<edge-id> ~ the edge id, as a vouch or a join names it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`member` params=`takes/key ~ a member's place in the realm`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`device` params=`takes/key ~ one device's relationship`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`realm` params=`takes/id ~ the realm the relationship rides`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`quorum` params=`kind/switch ~ sign with the seat quorum this vessel holds`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`partial` params=`kind/switch ~ with quorum=true: sign the seats held here and print a partial`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`voucher` params=`takes/key ~ partial: the vouch's voucher`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`joiner` params=`takes/key ~ partial: the vouch's joiner`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`as` params=`takes/index ~ the persona root that signs`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/aid ~ the Nexus whose charter seats the quorum`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the acting face, by persona index; absent, the one face standing open`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

