!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/persona-root-or-seats ~ signs with a persona root or the held seats; the reader decides whether that hand holds the edge`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · as-not-index · EdgeKapaeError · EdgeCosignError

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.edge.lowers edge/<edge-id>]] ~ name one relationship (an edge id, member= or device=); partial=true needs quorum=true and realm=`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`as-not-index` params=`cure/[[realm.edge.lowers edge/<edge-id> as/0]] ~ as= expects a persona-root index`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`EdgeKapaeError` params=`~ the act refused by name`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`EdgeCosignError` params=`~ the partial refused by name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

